        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Main Rules&lt;br&gt;- Data services are private&lt;br&gt;- Services SG reaches RDS and Valkey&lt;br&gt;- Valkey uses TLS&lt;br&gt;- Dev database access uses SSM, not SSH&lt;br&gt;- S3 uses SSE-S3 by default" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacing=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666" vertex="1" parent="aws">
